      The link may have changed. The work and the notebook are still here.
    </p>
    <div class="cta-row">
      <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/">Home</a>
      <a class="btn" href="/projects/">Projects</a>
      <a class="btn" href="/writing/">Writing</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</Base>
